Chu Yuan continued to go to school to use the energy gathering array;
He and Qida had already speculated that the murderer might come from the school.
And I injured the murderer yesterday, maybe I can find him today. Once he is found, then he will be dead!
And, this is not a very difficult thing;
His spiritual power is very special. He can't track it if he is far away, but once he comes into close contact, he can sense it immediately!
Unfortunately, I walked around the school at noon and didn't find anyone suspicious.
"Principal, does anyone ask for leave today?" Chu Yuan asked Qi Da directly;
He speculated that the murderer might be a certain teacher;
Qi Da shook his head, "I have already considered this. No teacher asked for leave today."
""
Chu Yuan frowned. Could it be that the murderer was not someone from the school? Was his and Qida's initial guess wrong?
After receiving a few more bottles of elixirs, Chu Yuan walked on campus, meditating alone;
Qi Da told him that the Anti-Martial Arts Bureau had intervened and the nature of the case had changed;
But it also told him not to worry. The Suppression Bureau was not afraid of the Li family and would not act recklessly under the pressure of the Li family.
However, Chu Yuan was still more concerned about one thing, and now he was sure that the other party was targeting him;
If no breakthrough is found from him, will it be harmful to his family?
For people who are bound to die if they are caught, they don't care about the saying that 'it won't bring harm to their families'.
The sound of sweeping came from behind, and Chu Yuan subconsciously moved out of the way;
A rickety figure walked slowly past him holding a broom.
It's the former genius from No. 1 Middle School
His experience gave Chu Yuan a warning and he did not dare to expose the differences between himself and ordinary warriors;
He just packages himself as an 'ordinary' martial arts genius.
But Chu Yuan's pupils suddenly shrank!
He felt a familiar scent on this cleaner!
You can’t go wrong! That is your own spiritual power!
But he didn't smell blood on him?
"Hello."
The ricket figure stopped and looked back at him, his eyes numb;
"What's your name?"
But the other party ignored him and turned around to sweep the floor by himself, as if he was deaf.
Chu Yuan's eyes darkened and he took action brazenly!
An afterimage was drawn under his feet, and he kicked directly towards the opponent's waist!
Unexpectedly, Chu Yuan did not feel any resistance, and the opponent was directly kicked several meters away by this powerful and heavy kick;
After a sound of cracking bones, the cleaner spurted blood from his mouth and fell to the ground, breathless.
"Chu Yuan! What are you doing!?" At this time, Miao Jun, the head teacher of the first class, passed by. After scolding him angrily, he ran towards the cleaner;
"Yan Xuan! Are you okay?" He put his hand on Yan Xuan's wrist and poured his inner breath into it without any reservation.
The strange thing is that Yan Xuan's internal injuries were not deep. Although a few bones were broken, his internal organs were not damaged.
Miao Jun was startled for a moment and thought it was normal;
After all, Chu Yuan has only been practicing for more than a week and has just entered the Qi and Blood realm. Naturally, his attack power is not that powerful.
"Yan Xuan?" Chu Yuan also knew this cleaner's name for the first time;
"Oh my god, is this Chu Yuan?"
"Yes, he is Chu Yuan from Class 2"
"Why did he attack the poor janitor?"
"I don't know, maybe I offended him."
"You can't be so harsh if you offend him, right? There's something wrong with his character."
